WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Read a timed turnover plan
Captioned sample walkthrough. Fictional Larkspur Cottage. Actual sample PDF excerpts; no customer footage.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:28.000
A fictional six-hour window
Checkout 10:00. Check-in 16:00. Larkspur Cottage is an invented example.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Keep the buffer visible
360 minutes minus a 30-minute buffer leaves 330 minutes to allocate.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Read the five budgets
Beds 85; bathrooms 70; kitchen 80; living 40; final walk 55 minutes.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:28.000
The plan ends at 15:30
The final walk ends at 15:30 in this plan. The buffer runs until 16:00.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:38.000
What this does not prove
These are allocated budgets, not measured cleaning times. The worksheet does not establish whether the work can realistically fit.

